{
  "_comment_apply": "Optional per-row \"apply\": \"now\" (the running game applies it at once), \"match\" (next match or level) or \"restart\" (default, next game start). Only the in-game overlay shows it (docs/OVERLAY.md).",
  "_comment": "Game-specific settings schema. Derived from ste_video.ini.sample / ste_enhance.ini.sample and the Max/Low ini files (docs/INTERFACE_ASSUMPTIONS.md). Key ids are '<file>.<key>'; 'd' = the game's default when the key is absent (null = no default).",
